---
layout: layouts/list.njk
title: Organizations We Support
description: Partners and organizations aligned with our mission
permalink: /organizations/
---
<p style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">
  We stand in solidarity with these organizations working toward justice, democracy, and human rights.
</p>

<div class="grid grid-2">
{% for org in collections.organizations %}
  <div class="card">
    <h3 class="card-title">
      {% if org.data.url %}
      <a href="{{ org.data.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ org.data.title }}</a>
      {% else %}
      {{ org.data.title }}
      {% endif %}
    </h3>
    <p class="card-description">{{ org.data.description }}</p>
    <a href="{{ org.url }}" style="margin-top: var(--spacing-sm); display: inline-block;">Read more &rarr;</a>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
